{"generated": "2026-11-11 21:21", "brief": "<b>1. 앤트로픽의 나스닥 IPO 추진과 시장의 엇갈린 시선</b>\n생성형 AI 스타트업 앤트로픽이 시장 변동성과 몸값 논란 속에서도 오는 19일 나스닥 상장을 강행하며 최대 640억~904억 달러 규모의 자금 조달에 나섭니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1uR2ZYaHE0SGFtdTdySG5vckhQVTg3RVpKVlFEajFhNWhja2N3TFRsU2pWc1pDMHp2QWlWbW1FTWZXWXd2R09OT2hXMUpoUmxLV1FLUzBER1RkQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#34</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQRlNNX2c5SGV4WXdpZ2Utb2NzU0NhVlpUM3MwWEZ3bFdyVHZ5cDZGbnJSWVpEelJrZ0tCQTZrNjUyRTFaLW1JeGxucWtvcEJwOXUyQkwzUkpPQUNEYTFobG9qc3oyTVhHb1VCeDRPck1xU2lla1NtMlY5VkExdmJobDJ6U01LbHgzYjZFTmFHYzFCVjRfM1VxRVJIeE40d3REMXlqT01qQnh5TEg1?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#36</a>]. 이번 IPO는 컴퓨팅 약정만 9,000억 달러에 달하며 밸류에이션 하락 우려에도 불구하고 AI 산업 전체의 향방을 가를 분수령으로 평가받고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE5EMl9UMXFFMkx5bXU3LUw1RWlka01IbG9GTlF2ako4TlFqdGlSVmw5NWx5bkNQZkZtQjZTc0MxWmw0TEVPcWc3d21R?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#33</a>].\n\n<b>2. 코스닥·글로벌 IPO 시장의 엇갈린 행보</b>\n의약품 유통 플랫폼 바로팜이 코스닥 입성에 성공한 반면 제이앤티지는 상장을 철회했으며, 솔리다임도 상장을 포기했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOVW9nSUpOTVpyNXhrcndGd0d0NnJtRmtqZU00TURHXzM5RTdGeFEyTmRYSEk3NlZkd2ZrUEJNbzAzOHhEY05wdmZKNEFBdHNlX21xdHd1VWpaakM3cVBGd09nMFpzbzBrQTBOYzkyWHNETFVFWVBBdWtjVE5VZEY0dHlpejI3NkF0R1E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#10</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5NY2RjcE5pNDBTZEpjQ0h2cmRqWkxQbi1HQjM4WnA0VkN0b2lBZmRxRTdWZ05BQ2lYc2x5b0xSYnBhZVZhTXlFNXlkS2Z1bHJ